# GRUB, target efi: the boot loader of the UEFI firmware (x86_64-efi), which grub-install
# --target=x86_64-efi writes into the EFI system partition. A package of its own (GRUB-efi_<ver>)
# with its own status: the default target is the one of the BIOS (i386-pc). The programs are the
# same, only the modules under /usr/lib/grub/<platform> differ
PKG_SUFFIX=-efi
CONF_FLAGS+=" --with-platform=efi"
